/Producer (PyPDF2)
/Title (A\040new\040almost\040perfect\040nonlinear\040function\040which\040is\040not\040quadratic)
/Author (Yves\040Edel\054\040Alexander\040Pott)
/Subject (Following\040an\040example\040in\040\13312\135\054\015\012we\040show\040how\040to\040change\040one\040coordinate\040function\040of\040an\015\012almost\040perfect\040nonlinear\015\012\050APN\051\040function\040in\040order\040to\040obtain\040new\040examples\056\040It\040turns\040out\040that\015\012this\040is\040a\040very\040powerful\040method\040to\040construct\040new\015\012APN\040functions\056\040In\040particular\054\040we\040show\040that\040our\040approach\040can\015\012be\040used\040to\040construct\040a\040\047\047non\055quadratic\047\047\040APN\040function\056\015\012This\040new\040example\015\012is\040in\040remarkable\040contrast\040to\040all\040recently\040constructed\040functions\040which\015\012have\040all\040been\040quadratic\056\015\012An\040equivalent\040function\040has\040been\040found\015\012\040independently\015\012by\040Brinkmann\040and\040Leander\040\1338\135\056\040However\054\040they\015\012claimed\040that\040their\040function\040is\040CCZ\040equivalent\040to\040a\040quadratic\040one\056\040In\040this\015\012paper\040we\040give\040several\040reasons\015\012why\040this\040new\040function\040is\040not\040equivalent\040to\040a\040quadratic\040one\056)
/Keywords (01\040Jan\0402009\054\040Advances\040in\040Mathematics\040of\040Communications\054\040Parent\040function\054\040Function\040\050mathematics\051\054\040Quadratic\040equation)
>>
